":"fengkx","email":"liangkx8237@gmail.com"},{"name":"liuyanjie","email":"469835132@qq.com"},{"name":"justan","email":"ckr189@gmail.com"},{"name":"woodenstone","email":"link1024@outlook.com"},{"name":"miusuncle","email":"miusuncle@gmail.com"},{"name":"yuzhen","email":"112287812@qq.com"},{"name":"wedabot","email":"wedadevops@tencent.com"},{"name":"joeyren","email":"1412687451@qq.com"},{"name":"byronpiao","email":"byronpiao@outlook.com"},{"name":"yandrewding","email":"yanzhuoding@gmail.com"},{"name":"areo-joe","email":"zengjoe@foxmail.com"},{"name":"coylexie","email":"coylexie@tencent.com"},{"name":"lukejyhuang","email":"lukejyhuang@tencent.com"}],"readme":"## cloudbase-adapter-wx_mp\n\n[![NPM Version](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/cloudbase-adapter-wx_mp.svg?style=flat)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/cloudbase-adapter-wx_mp)\n[![](https://img.shields.io/npm/dt/cloudbase-adapter-wx_mp.svg)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/cloudbase-adapter-wx_mp)\n\ntcb-js-sdk适配器接口，各平台适配器按照此接口规范进行开发。\n\n## 安装\n```bash\nnpm i cloudbase-adapter-wx_mp -S\n```\n\n### Unpkg(推荐)\n可以使用unpkg托管的js文件，地址如下：\nhttps://unpkg.com/cloudbase-adapter-wx_mp/dist/index.js\n\n## 使用\n```javascript\nimport tcb from 'tsb-js-sdk';\nimport adapterForWxMp from 'cloudbase-adapter-wx_mp';\n\n// 以下两种方式二选一\n// 1.单参数传入\ntcb.useAdapters(adapterForWxMp);\n// 2.数组形式传参\ntcb.useAdapters([adapterForWxMp]);\n// adapter必须在init之前传入\ntcb.init();\n```","readmeFilename":"README.md"}